o act before complaining."},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"Complaining is more useful than taking action."},{"id":"correct","text":"Rather than complain, it is better to take action."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"与其抱怨，不如采取行动。 means: Rather than complain, it is better to take action.","audioText":"与其抱怨，不如采取行动。"},{"id":"exercise-advanced-alternatives-pattern","type":"choice","prompt":"In these examples, what does 与其 … 不如 … express?","options":[{"id":"distractor-1","text":"尽管 introduces a concession: an acknowledged difficulty does not prevent the main outcome."},{"id":"correct","text":"与其 presents an option the speaker considers less useful, and 不如 introduces the preferred alternative."},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"既然 introduces an accepted premise and 就 connects it to a consequent decision or recommendation."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"与其 presents an option the speaker considers less useful, and 不如 introduces the preferred alternative. Keep the two actions or propositions comparable."},{"id":"exercise-advanced-alternatives-build","type":"order","prompt":"Build: Rather than complain, it is better to take action.","tokens":["与其","抱怨","，","不如","采取","行动","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["与其","抱怨","，","不如","采取","行动","。"]],"explanation":"与其抱怨，不如采取行动。 — 与其 presents an option the speaker considers less useful, and 不如 introduces the preferred alternative. Keep the two actions or propositions comparable.","hint":"Use the pattern 与其 … 不如 …."},{"id":"exercise-advanced-alternatives-word","type":"choice","prompt":"Which meaning matches 与其 (yǔqí)?","options":[{"id":"distractor-0","text":"logic"},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"dragon"},{"id":"correct","text":"rather than"}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"与其 means rather than."},{"id":"exercise-advanced-alternatives-transfer","type":"order","prompt":"Apply the pattern: Rather than waste time, it is better to prepare carefully.","tokens":["与其","浪费","时间","，","不如","认真","准备","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["与其","浪费","时间","，","不如","认真","准备","。"]],"explanation":"与其浪费时间，不如认真准备。 — Rather than waste time, it is better to prepare carefully.","hint":"Use the pattern 与其 … 不如 …."}],"grammarTopicIds":["grammar-advanced-alternatives"],"vocabularyIds":["hearmandarin:w05208","hearmandarin:w02035","hearmandarin:w03288","hearmandarin:w02086","hearmandarin:w01453","hearmandarin:w00817"],"features":[]},{"id":"lesson-advanced-arguments","kind":"lesson","source":"platform","revision":1,"publication":"published","languageLevel":"advanced","difficulty":"balanced","title":"Building a balanced argument","description":"Practise 不仅 … 而且 … in a short, connected advanced lesson.","minutes":9,"category":"other","line":"everyday","position":{"x":580,"y":110},"prerequisites":["lesson-advanced-decisions"],"objectives":["Use 不仅 … 而且 … in context.","Connect a Chinese example to its meaning and build a second sentence."],"explanation":["不仅 and 而且 connect an initial point with a further point. Here, both benefits belong to the same policy, so the subject stays before 不仅.","Read and listen: 这项政策不仅提高了效率，而且减少了浪费。 (Zhè xiàng zhèngcè bùjǐn tígāo le xiàolǜ, érqiě jiǎnshǎo le làngfèi.) — This policy improves efficiency and also reduces waste.","Try a new context: 这个方案不仅合理，而且容易实施。 (Zhège fāng’àn bùjǐn hélǐ, érqiě róngyì shíshī.) — This plan is not only reasonable but also easy to implement."],"examples":[{"hanzi":"这项政策不仅提高了效率，而且减少了浪费。","pinyin":"Zhè xiàng zhèngcè bùjǐn tígāo le xiàolǜ, érqiě jiǎnshǎo le làngfèi.","meaning":"This policy improves efficiency and also reduces waste."},{"hanzi":"这个方案不仅合理，而且容易实施。","pinyin":"Zhège fāng’àn bùjǐn hélǐ, érqiě róngyì shíshī.","meaning":"This plan is not only reasonable but also easy to implement."}],"questions":[{"id":"lesson-advanced-arguments-meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"Listen or read the example. What does it mean?","options":[{"id":"correct","text":"This policy improves efficiency and also reduces waste."},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"This policy improves efficiency but increases waste."},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"This policy reduces waste without improving efficiency."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"这项政策不仅提高了效率，而且减少了浪费。 means: This policy improves efficiency and also reduces waste.","audioText":"这项政策不仅提高了效率，而且减少了浪费。"},{"id":"lesson-advanced-arguments-pattern","type":"choice","prompt":"In these examples, what does 不仅 … 而且 … express?","options":[{"id":"distractor-0","text":"尽管 introduces a concession: an acknowledged difficulty does not prevent the main outcome."},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"既然 introduces an accepted premise and 就 connects it to a consequent decision or recommendation."},{"id":"correct","text":"不仅 and 而且 connect an initial point with a further point."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"不仅 and 而且 connect an initial point with a further point. Here, both benefits belong to the same policy, so the subject stays before 不仅."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-arguments-build","type":"order","prompt":"Build: This policy improves efficiency and also reduces waste.","tokens":["这","项","政策","不仅","提高","了","效率","，","而且","减少","了","浪费","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["这","项","政策","不仅","提高","了","效率","，","而且","减少","了","浪费","。"]],"explanation":"这项政策不仅提高了效率，而且减少了浪费。 — 不仅 and 而且 connect an initial point with a further point. Here, both benefits belong to the same policy, so the subject stays before 不仅.","hint":"Use the pattern 不仅 … 而且 …."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-arguments-word","type":"choice","prompt":"Which meaning matches 政策 (zhèngcè)?","options":[{"id":"correct","text":"policy"},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"close"},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"clear; definite; to clarify"}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"政策 means policy."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-arguments-transfer","type":"order","prompt":"Apply the pattern: This plan is not only reasonable but also easy to implement.","tokens":["这个","方案","不仅","合理","，","而且","容易","实施","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["这个","方案","不仅","合理","，","而且","容易","实施","。"]],"explanation":"这个方案不仅合理，而且容易实施。 — This plan is not only reasonable but also easy to implement.","hint":"Use the pattern 不仅 … 而且 …."}],"grammarTopicIds":["grammar-advanced-arguments"],"vocabularyIds":["hearmandarin:w05288","hearmandarin:w03272","hearmandarin:w01453","hearmandarin:w03571","hearmandarin:w02378","hearmandarin:w03017"],"features":[]},{"id":"lesson-advanced-conditions","kind":"lesson","source":"platform","revision":1,"publication":"published","languageLevel":"advanced","difficulty":"challenging","title":"Conditions and commitment","description":"Practise 无论 … 都 … in a short, connected advanced lesson.","minutes":12,"category":"other","line":"sentences","position":{"x":740,"y":210},"prerequisites":["lesson-advanced-alternatives","lesson-advanced-arguments"],"objectives":["Use 无论 … 都 … in context.","Connect a Chinese example to its meaning and build a second sentence."],"explanation":["无论 introduces a range of possible conditions, often with a question word. 都 states the outcome that stays the same across those conditions.","Read and listen: 无论遇到什么困难，我们都不会放弃。 (Wúlùn yùdào shénme kùnnan, wǒmen dōu bú huì fàngqì.) — Whatever difficulties we encounter, we will not give up.","Try a new context: 无论结果如何，我们都承担责任。 (Wúlùn jiéguǒ rúhé, wǒmen dōu chéngdān zérèn.) — Whatever the result, we will accept responsibility."],"examples":[{"hanzi":"无论遇到什么困难，我们都不会放弃。","pinyin":"Wúlùn yùdào shénme kùnnan, wǒmen dōu bú huì fàngqì.","meaning":"Whatever difficulties we encounter, we will not give up."},{"hanzi":"无论结果如何，我们都承担责任。","pinyin":"Wúlùn jiéguǒ rúhé, wǒmen dōu chéngdān zérèn.","meaning":"Whatever the result, we will accept responsibility."}],"questions":[{"id":"lesson-advanced-conditions-meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"Listen or read the example. What does it mean?","options":[{"id":"distractor-1","text":"We will not encounter any difficulties if we refuse to give up."},{"id":"correct","text":"Whatever difficulties we encounter, we will not give up."},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"We will give up only if the difficulties are too great."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"无论遇到什么困难，我们都不会放弃。 means: Whatever difficulties we encounter, we will not give up.","audioText":"无论遇到什么困难，我们都不会放弃。"},{"id":"lesson-advanced-conditions-pattern","type":"choice","prompt":"In these examples, what does 无论 … 都 … express?","options":[{"id":"correct","text":"无论 introduces a range of possible conditions, often with a question word."},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"尽管 introduces a concession: an acknowledged difficulty does not prevent the main outcome."},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"既然 introduces an accepted premise and 就 connects it to a consequent decision or recommendation."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"无论 introduces a range of possible conditions, often with a question word. 都 states the outcome that stays the same across those conditions."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-conditions-build","type":"order","prompt":"Build: Whatever difficulties we encounter, we will not give up.","tokens":["无论","遇到","什么","困难","，","我们","都","不","会","放弃","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["无论","遇到","什么","困难","，","我们","都","不","会","放弃","。"]],"explanation":"无论遇到什么困难，我们都不会放弃。 — 无论 introduces a range of possible conditions, often with a question word. 都 states the outcome that stays the same across those conditions.","hint":"Use the pattern 无论 … 都 …."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-conditions-word","type":"choice","prompt":"Which meaning matches 承担 (chéngdān)?","options":[{"id":"distractor-1","text":"jeans"},{"id":"correct","text":"to undertake"},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"even"}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"承担 means to undertake."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-conditions-transfer","type":"order","prompt":"Apply the pattern: Whatever the result, we will accept responsibility.","tokens":["无论","结果","如何","，","我们","都","承担","责任","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["无论","结果","如何","，","我们","都","承担","责任","。"]],"explanation":"无论结果如何，我们都承担责任。 — Whatever the result, we will accept responsibility.","hint":"Use the pattern 无论 … 都 …."}],"grammarTopicIds":["grammar-advanced-conditions"],"vocabularyIds":["hearmandarin:w02137","hearmandarin:w01920","hearmandarin:w01197","hearmandarin:w02934","hearmandarin:w01784","hearmandarin:w01446"],"features":[]},{"id":"lesson-advanced-proposal-checkpoint","kind":"lesson","source":"platform","revision":1,"publication":"published","languageLevel":"advanced","difficulty":"challenging","title":"Make a reasoned proposal","description":"Practise 之所以 … 是因为 … in a short, connected advanced lesson.","minutes":12,"category":"other","line":"sentences","position":{"x":900,"y":210},"prerequisites":["lesson-advanced-conditions"],"objectives":["Use 之所以 … 是因为 … in context.","Connect a Chinese example to its meaning and build a second sentence."],"explanation":["之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation. Use evidence and a clear causal relation; the pattern itself does not make an argument valid.","Read and listen: 我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。 (Wǒ zhī suǒyǐ zhīchí zhège fāng’àn, shì yīnwèi tā gèng hélǐ.) — The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable.","Try a new context: 我们之所以改变计划，是因为发现了新的证据。 (Wǒmen zhī suǒyǐ gǎibiàn jìhuà, shì yīnwèi fāxiàn le xīn de zhèngjù.) — We changed the plan because we found new evidence."],"examples":[{"hanzi":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhī suǒyǐ zhīchí zhège fāng’àn, shì yīnwèi tā gèng hélǐ.","meaning":"The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable."},{"hanzi":"我们之所以改变计划，是因为发现了新的证据。","pinyin":"Wǒmen zhī suǒyǐ gǎibiàn jìhuà, shì yīnwèi fāxiàn le xīn de zhèngjù.","meaning":"We changed the plan because we found new evidence."}],"questions":[{"id":"lesson-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"Listen or read the example. What does it mean?","options":[{"id":"distractor-0","text":"The reason this plan is reasonable is that I support it."},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"I support this plan even though it is less reasonable."},{"id":"correct","text":"The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。 means: The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable.","audioText":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。"},{"id":"lesson-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-pattern","type":"choice","prompt":"In these examples, what does 之所以 … 是因为 … express?","options":[{"id":"distractor-1","text":"尽管 introduces a concession: an acknowledged difficulty does not prevent the main outcome."},{"id":"correct","text":"之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation."},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"既然 introduces an accepted premise and 就 connects it to a consequent decision or recommendation."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation. Use evidence and a clear causal relation; the pattern itself does not make an argument valid."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-build","type":"order","prompt":"Build: The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable.","tokens":["我","之所以","支持","这个","方案","，","是","因为","它","更","合理","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["我","之所以","支持","这个","方案","，","是","因为","它","更","合理","。"]],"explanation":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。 — 之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation. Use evidence and a clear causal relation; the pattern itself does not make an argument valid.","hint":"Use the pattern 之所以 … 是因为 …."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-word","type":"choice","prompt":"Which meaning matches 合理 (hélǐ)?","options":[{"id":"distractor-0","text":"character"},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"to cooperate; to coordinate with"},{"id":"correct","text":"rational"}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"合理 means rational."},{"id":"lesson-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-transfer","type":"order","prompt":"Apply the pattern: We changed the plan because we found new evidence.","tokens":["我们","之所以","改变","计划","，","是","因为","发现","了","新","的","证据","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["我们","之所以","改变","计划","，","是","因为","发现","了","新","的","证据","。"]],"explanation":"我们之所以改变计划，是因为发现了新的证据。 — We changed the plan because we found new evidence.","hint":"Use the pattern 之所以 … 是因为 …."}],"grammarTopicIds":["grammar-advanced-proposal-checkpoint"],"vocabularyIds":["hearmandarin:w02477","hearmandarin:w02339","hearmandarin:w03495","hearmandarin:w02603","hearmandarin:w01939","hearmandarin:w01219"],"features":[]},{"id":"exercise-advanced-proposal-checkpoint","kind":"exercise","source":"platform","revision":1,"publication":"published","languageLevel":"advanced","difficulty":"challenging","title":"Make a reasoned proposal · practice","description":"A standalone practice session. The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable.","minutes":12,"category":"other","line":"sentences","position":{"x":900,"y":210},"prerequisites":[],"objectives":["Use 之所以 … 是因为 … in context.","Connect a Chinese example to its meaning and build a second sentence."],"explanation":["之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation. Use evidence and a clear causal relation; the pattern itself does not make an argument valid.","Read and listen: 我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。 (Wǒ zhī suǒyǐ zhīchí zhège fāng’àn, shì yīnwèi tā gèng hélǐ.) — The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable.","Try a new context: 我们之所以改变计划，是因为发现了新的证据。 (Wǒmen zhī suǒyǐ gǎibiàn jìhuà, shì yīnwèi fāxiàn le xīn de zhèngjù.) — We changed the plan because we found new evidence."],"examples":[{"hanzi":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。","pinyin":"Wǒ zhī suǒyǐ zhīchí zhège fāng’àn, shì yīnwèi tā gèng hélǐ.","meaning":"The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable."},{"hanzi":"我们之所以改变计划，是因为发现了新的证据。","pinyin":"Wǒmen zhī suǒyǐ gǎibiàn jìhuà, shì yīnwèi fāxiàn le xīn de zhèngjù.","meaning":"We changed the plan because we found new evidence."}],"questions":[{"id":"exercise-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-meaning","type":"choice","prompt":"Listen or read the example. What does it mean?","options":[{"id":"distractor-1","text":"I support this plan even though it is less reasonable."},{"id":"correct","text":"The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable."},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"The reason this plan is reasonable is that I support it."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。 means: The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable.","audioText":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。"},{"id":"exercise-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-pattern","type":"choice","prompt":"In these examples, what does 之所以 … 是因为 … express?","options":[{"id":"correct","text":"之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation."},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"既然 introduces an accepted premise and 就 connects it to a consequent decision or recommendation."},{"id":"distractor-1","text":"尽管 introduces a concession: an acknowledged difficulty does not prevent the main outcome."}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation. Use evidence and a clear causal relation; the pattern itself does not make an argument valid."},{"id":"exercise-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-build","type":"order","prompt":"Build: The reason I support this plan is that it is more reasonable.","tokens":["我","之所以","支持","这个","方案","，","是","因为","它","更","合理","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["我","之所以","支持","这个","方案","，","是","因为","它","更","合理","。"]],"explanation":"我之所以支持这个方案，是因为它更合理。 — 之所以 introduces the claim whose reason is explained, and 是因为 gives the explanation. Use evidence and a clear causal relation; the pattern itself does not make an argument valid.","hint":"Use the pattern 之所以 … 是因为 …."},{"id":"exercise-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-word","type":"choice","prompt":"Which meaning matches 合理 (hélǐ)?","options":[{"id":"distractor-1","text":"to destroy; to damage"},{"id":"correct","text":"rational"},{"id":"distractor-0","text":"gasoline"}],"answer":"correct","explanation":"合理 means rational."},{"id":"exercise-advanced-proposal-checkpoint-transfer","type":"order","prompt":"Apply the pattern: We changed the plan because we found new evidence.","tokens":["我们","之所以","改变","计划","，","是","因为","发现","了","新","的","证据","。"],"acceptedOrders":[["我们","之所以","改变","计划","，","是","因为","发现","了","新","的","证据","。"]],"explanation":"我们之所以改变计划，是因为发现了新的证据。 — We changed the plan because we found new evidence.","hint":"Use the pattern 之所以 … 是因为 …."}],"grammarTopicIds":["grammar-advanced-proposal-checkpoint"],"vocabularyIds":["hearmandarin:w02477","hearmandarin:w02339","hearmandarin:w03495","hearmandarin:w02603","hearmandarin:w01939","hearmandarin:w01219"],"features":[]}],"sentences":[{"id":"sentence-elementary-getting-around","languageLevel":"elementary","difficulty":"gentle","meaning":"How do I get from here to the railway station?","pinyin":"Cóng zhèr dào huǒchēzhàn zěnme zǒu?","tokens":["从","这儿","到","火车站","怎么","走"],"punctuation":"？","grammarTopicId":"grammar-elementary-getting-around","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"从 … 到 …"},{"label":"Example","text":"从这儿到火车站怎么走？"}]},{"id":"sentence-elementary-making-plans","languageLevel":"elementary","difficulty":"balanced","meaning":"Tomorrow I am going travelling with a friend.","pinyin":"Míngtiān wǒ yào hé péngyou yìqǐ qù lǚyóu.","tokens":["明天","我","要","和","朋友","一起","去","旅游"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-elementary-making-plans","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"要 + action"},{"label":"Example","text":"明天我要和朋友一起去旅游。"}]},{"id":"sentence-elementary-finished-actions","languageLevel":"elementary","difficulty":"balanced","meaning":"Yesterday I bought a book.","pinyin":"Zuótiān wǒ mǎi le yì běn shū.","tokens":["昨天","我","买","了","一","本","书"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-elementary-finished-actions","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"verb + 了"},{"label":"Example","text":"昨天我买了一本书。"}]},{"id":"sentence-intermediate-experiences","languageLevel":"intermediate","difficulty":"gentle","meaning":"I have been to Beijing.","pinyin":"Wǒ qù guo Běijīng.","tokens":["我","去","过","北京"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-intermediate-experiences","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"verb + 过"},{"label":"Example","text":"我去过北京。"}]},{"id":"sentence-intermediate-ongoing-actions","languageLevel":"intermediate","difficulty":"balanced","meaning":"He is preparing for an exam.","pinyin":"Tā zhèngzài zhǔnbèi kǎoshì.","tokens":["他","正在","准备","考试"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-intermediate-ongoing-actions","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"正在 + action"},{"label":"Example","text":"他正在准备考试。"}]},{"id":"sentence-intermediate-results","languageLevel":"intermediate","difficulty":"balanced","meaning":"I understood this story after listening to it.","pinyin":"Wǒ tīngdǒng le zhège gùshi.","tokens":["我","听","懂","了","这个","故事"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-intermediate-results","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"verb + result complement"},{"label":"Example","text":"我听懂了这个故事。"}]},{"id":"sentence-advanced-viewpoints","languageLevel":"advanced","difficulty":"gentle","meaning":"Despite the difficulties, we still stand by this decision.","pinyin":"Jǐnguǎn cúnzài kùnnan, wǒmen réngrán jiānchí zhège juédìng.","tokens":["尽管","存在","困难","，","我们","仍然","坚持","这个","决定"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-advanced-viewpoints","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"尽管 … 仍然 …"},{"label":"Example","text":"尽管存在困难，我们仍然坚持这个决定。"}]},{"id":"sentence-advanced-decisions","languageLevel":"advanced","difficulty":"balanced","meaning":"Since everyone agrees, let us begin.","pinyin":"Jìrán dàjiā dōu tóngyì, wǒmen jiù kāishǐ ba.","tokens":["既然","大家","都","同意","，","我们","就","开始","吧"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-advanced-decisions","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"既然 … 就 …"},{"label":"Example","text":"既然大家都同意，我们就开始吧。"}]},{"id":"sentence-advanced-alternatives","languageLevel":"advanced","difficulty":"balanced","meaning":"Rather than complain, it is better to take action.","pinyin":"Yǔqí bàoyuàn, bùrú cǎiqǔ xíngdòng.","tokens":["与其","抱怨","，","不如","采取","行动"],"punctuation":"。","grammarTopicId":"grammar-advanced-alternatives","grammarParts":[{"label":"Pattern","text":"与其 … 不如 …"},{"label":"Example","text":"与其抱怨，不如采取行动。"}]}]}$curriculum$::jsonb;
begin
  select * into current_row from public.platform_catalog where id='hanzi-platform' for update;
  if not found then raise exception 'Apply the platform catalog migration first.'; end if;
  next_pack := current_row.data;
  -- Insert only missing IDs/revisions; never resurrect or overwrite an editor's work.
  foreach bucket in array array['vocabulary','grammarTopics','activities','sentences'] loop
    if bucket='vocabulary' and exists(select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(additions->bucket) incoming join jsonb_array_elements(next_pack->bucket) old on old->>'id'=incoming->>'id' where old->>'hanzi'<>incoming->>'hanzi') then
      raise exception 'A vocabulary identity was reassigned. Resolve the conflict before upgrading.';
    end if;
    select coalesce(jsonb_agg(incoming order by n),'[]') into pending
      from jsonb_array_elements(additions->bucket) with ordinality q(incoming,n)
      where not exists(select 1 from jsonb_array_elements(next_pack->bucket) old where old->>'id'=incoming->>'id' and (bucket<>'activities' or old->'revision'=incoming->'revision'));
    next_pack := jsonb_set(next_pack,array[bucket],(next_pack->bucket)||pending);
  end loop;
  next_pack := jsonb_set(next_pack,'{taxonomy,vocabularySelection,hsk2Levels}','[1,2,3,4,5,6]');
  next_pack := jsonb_set(next_pack,'{taxonomy,categories}',(select jsonb_agg(case
    when c->>'id'='all' and c->>'title'='All words' then c||jsonb_build_object('description','Vocabulary from HSK 2.0 levels 1–6, filtered to your chosen level.')
    when c->>'id'='other' and c->>'title'='Phrases and grammar' then c||jsonb_build_object('title','More words and expressions','description','Expressions, descriptive words and additional vocabulary.')
    else c end order by n) from jsonb_array_elements(next_pack->'taxonomy'->'categories') with ordinality q(c,n)));
  perform private.validate_platform_catalog(next_pack);
  if next_pack is distinct from current_row.data then
    update public.platform_catalog set data=next_pack, revision=revision+1, updated_at=now() where id=current_row.id;
  end if;
end;
$upgrade$;
commit;
